  "content": {
    "title": "中共吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心支部委员会组织全体党员集体观看“伟大历程 辉煌成就--庆祝中华人民共和国成立70周年大型成就展”网上展馆",
    "source": "吉林省就业指导中心",
    "publishDate": "2019-11-28",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:calibri; mso-hansi-font-family:calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'times=\"\" new=\"\" roman';font-size:16.0000pt;=\"\" mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">中共吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心支部委员会组织全体党员集体观看“伟大历程&nbsp;辉煌成就--庆祝中华人民共和国成立70周年大型成就展”网上展馆<spanyes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:calibri; mso-hansi-font-family:calibri;mso-bidi-font-family:'times=\"\" new=\"\" roman';font-size:16.0000pt;=\"\" mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:calibri;></spanyes';font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:calibri;></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/0af67a140ad87580b597143da1e540743d446d1d2e6480ff6ccdd3ae1c08ca0a.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:9.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:tahoma;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">2019年11月27日下午，按照省教育厅（省委教育工委）“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育领导小组转发《关于组织党员干部参观“伟大历程&nbsp;辉煌成就--庆祝中华人民共和国成立70周年大型成就展”网上展馆》的通知要求，在中心510会议室，中心党支部与长春教育宾馆党支部联合开展观看“伟大历程&nbsp;辉煌成就--庆祝中华人民共和国成立70周年大型成就展”网上展馆党日活动。活动由中心党支部书记李凌红主持，中心党支部和教育宾馆党支部全体党员以及积极分子参加。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/f0440d61911e8e8b274e52aeb472d76a0abe5e22973ee0e65e2ec9fd80ddb991.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">中心党支部书记传达省教育厅（省委教育工委）“不忘初心、牢记使命”主题教育领导小组转发中央“不忘初心 牢记使命”主题教育领导小组下发《关于组织党员干部参观“伟大历程 辉煌成就--庆祝中华人民共和国成立70周年大型成就展”及网上展馆》的通知要求，通报中心党支部落实此项工作的安排，要求全体党员在观看网上展馆之后，要利用业余时间详细了解祖国70年伟大成就，以党小组形式交流参观心得，确保参观交流全覆盖。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:32.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">在中心党支部副书记孙洋引领下，通过网络平台，大家用近2个小时一起观看了“成就展”网上展馆。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 32pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/34b2ba8e52f05d0b3c49caf48997c57d4d44034c83fd6461e5b3392bbd6a52ab.png\" style=\"text-align: left; max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:24.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">此次展览紧紧围绕开辟和发展中国特色社会主义道路、建设社会主义现代化国家的主题，以编年体为时间主线，将1949年新中国成立至今的中华人民共和国历史一一展现人们眼前。展览共分为“序言”“屹立东方”“改革开放”“走向复兴”“人间正道”等五个部分。通过网上展厅的画面展示，大家切实感受到在中国共产党的领导下，新中国从站起来到富起来再到强起来的伟大历程，深刻感受到新中国成立70周年走过的伟大历程与取得的辉煌成就，心中的民族自豪感和历史责任感油然而生。我们要继续高举中国特色社会主义的伟大旗帜，继往开来，砥砺前行，不忘初心担使命，同心共筑中国梦。<spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top:3.7500pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:3.7500pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);><img src=\"assets/15f7993cf38f27332b5c21059052efa33c6b5b51c4f42ff0c5d422df75de213a.png\" style=\"text-align: left; max-width: 100%;\"></span></p><p class=\"p\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 3.75pt 0pt; text-indent: 24pt;\"><spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt;font-weight:normal;text-transform:none;=\"\" font-style:normal;font-size:15.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"=\"\"><o:p style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</o:p></spanyes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);></p><p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\"  DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"true\"  DefSemiHidden=\"true\"  DefQFormat=\"false\"  DefPriority=\"99\"  LatentStyleCount=\"260\" >\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"Normal\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 1\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 2\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 3\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 4\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 5\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 6\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 7\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 8\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"heading 9\" ></w:LsdException>\n<w:LsdException Locked=\"false\"  Priority=\"99\"  SemiHidden=\"false\"  Name=\"index 1\" ></